        "speaker": "assistant",
        "stance": "condition",
        "stance_id": "stance_t5_condition_02",
        "text": "If her answer is genuinely \"yes, I want to see you do that,\" then option B becomes a joint decision and a shared risk. If her answer is \"you've been distracted and unavailable for a year and this sounds like more of that,\" then B becomes a marriage-risk, not a career-risk.",
